{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":124576,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793439206659,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q04iaBwttTGOBLsLetCvKWFVFjD.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2916096","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「……マジに買っちゃった」高校生の澤家月光（ゲッコーちゃん）は、幼なじみのあなたがASMRにハマっていると聞きつけ、自らもASMRに挑戦すべくダミーヘッドマイクを購入し、今まさにASMRの世界に飛び込もうとしていた。「これは、ハマっちゃったら……ダメなやつかも」。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-10-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gPEyi3jkujAcxicioSkLCvRslL4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gPEyi3jkujAcxicioSkLCvRslL4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"3278766","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"口ベタで友達作りが苦手な高校生の鏡秋水（アキミズちゃん）は、同じ学校に通うゲッコーちゃんがASMRにハマっていると知り、ゲッコーちゃんと仲良くなるためにASMRの勉強をはじめる。スマホの検索画面と睨めっこしながらダミーヘッドマイクに向かい「赤ちゃん言葉も……ASMRでは有効……？」","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-10-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hVegu514pfWLdnaFF9JwTDVwALa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hVegu514pfWLdnaFF9JwTDVwALa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"3278767","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"暑い夏の日。実家に帰ってきたゲッコーちゃんの姉・澤家陽光（ヨーコーさん）は、縁側に置かれたダミーヘッドマイクを見つける。氷をグラスに入れ、水を注ぎながら、聞こえてくる氷のぶつかる音にうっとり。「お姉ちゃんといっしょに……ねんね、しよっか……」","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-10-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1PLwO2CVyN3mtM4tZM3Ww4e8Erl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1PLwO2CVyN3mtM4tZM3Ww4e8Erl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"3278768","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ダミーヘッドマイク越しに向かい合ったゲッコーちゃんとアキミズちゃん。まだ友達としての距離感をつかめず、ぎこちないふたり。冷えた炭酸水をゆっくりとコップに注ぎその音に耳をすまし「しゅわしゅわしゅわしゅわ……」。そんな中、ゲッコーちゃんからアキミズちゃんにお願い事が？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ohUOdbE3DmEpuFthfJNaX6rX796.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ohUOdbE3DmEpuFthfJNaX6rX796.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"3278769","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"澤家雨読は、娘であるゲッコーちゃんの部屋でダミーヘッドマイクを見つける。驚きながらも慣れた手つきで綿棒をダミーヘッドマイクの耳へ入れ、耳かきを始める雨読。しかし、思い出すのは幼い頃の娘たちの姿で……「ママでちゅよぉ……さっぱりしまちょうねー」","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l6RCks3649nce6OOCEu7ZhtyGG0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l6RCks3649nce6OOCEu7ZhtyGG0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"3319850","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「クリームって……癒されるのかしら……？」今日もASMRの勉強に余念がないアキミズちゃんは、たっぷりと手に取ったハンドクリームをもみくちゃにしていく。さらにその手をダミーヘッドマイクの耳元に近づけ「このお手々で……お耳……ぐーって握ってほしいですか？」","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d9geBEeq6oiL6wu51lwfTKy51RB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d9geBEeq6oiL6wu51lwfTKy51RB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"3319851","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大好きな兄に近づくゲッコーちゃんの影を察知した、あたなの双子の妹ナナコとカナコ。兄を取り返すため、ダミーヘッドマイクにスクイーズを近づけ心地の良い音を探っていく。さらに、兄が喜びそうな言葉をささやきはじめるふたり「お兄……好きだよ……ちゅーき……ちゅき……♪」","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wJVS4gFbO3svo1N1A77mtROZh9U.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wJVS4gFbO3svo1N1A77mtROZh9U.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"3319852","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バーのマスター・二郎は閉店後の店内でタバコに火を付ける。「また耳かきか……飽きないな」深夜の街の喧騒と、ネオンの光に照らされた店内で耳かきをはじめた二郎は、グラスにウィスキーを注ぎ氷を鳴らす。「この音、聞いていたいのか？相変わらず、変な趣味……」","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t5AqCNS9KLh4rf7uAiq1UoVOnqx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t5AqCNS9KLh4rf7uAiq1UoVOnqx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"3366787","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"仕事から独り暮らしの部屋へ帰ってきたヨーコーさん。カップラーメンで夜ご飯を済ませ、お風呂上がりには何よりの楽しみである挽きたての豆で淹れたコーヒーを飲む時間、残りの仕事も片付けて……ヨーコーさんの帰宅後のルーティンをこっそり観察します。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5zI6SND5RVWKV8dQnQdqxPDB2CA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5zI6SND5RVWKV8dQnQdqxPDB2CA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"3380973","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「ばぶちゃん、おっきちたの？」赤ちゃんを覗き込む雨読とヨーコーさん。ガラガラとおしゃぶりを手に取った二人は、ささやき声や子守唄で赤ちゃんを寝かしつけます「ママとお姉ちゃんにぃたーっぷり、あまあま、でちゅよー」。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wTqSmQmM8hAfbDRTi9JdeyxJcV9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wTqSmQmM8hAfbDRTi9JdeyxJcV9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"3394980","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"あなたに近づくために始めたASMRへの興味が高じ、ついに電動耳かきを手にしたゲッコーちゃん。「じゃ、弱でこんな威力なの……」徐々にパワーを上げ、耳かきをダミヘに近づけていく「う……こ、こんなん……入れちゃったら……」。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/18djvNa6ZYf6BAic3BTZWB6dWre.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/18djvNa6ZYf6BAic3BTZWB6dWre.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"3412860","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"あなたの来訪を待つゲッコーちゃんとアキミズちゃん、ヨーコーさん、そして雨読。耳かきやクリームを手にした四人はダミーヘッドマイクを囲み、あなたを幸せにするためのASMRの練習を始める。「こ、こんなんで……ホントに喜んでくれるのかな……」。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fsQCTs2qzGjmf85plbRdtPuecWx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fsQCTs2qzGjmf85plbRdtPuecWx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/124576/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793439206659,"status":"ok","re